classDiagram
class EngineSession {
  -IRuntime m_runtime
  -ICudaEngine m_engine
  -IExecutionContext m_context
  -cudaStream m_stream
  -string m_inputName
  -size_t m_inputCount
  -map m_device
  -map m_outputs
  +EngineSession(plan, logger)
  +~EngineSession()
  +run(input) Outputs
  +benchmark(input, iterations) float
  +inspect() string
  -release() void noexcept
}
EngineSession *-- IRuntime : 独占运行时与引擎
EngineSession *-- IExecutionContext : 串行执行上下文
EngineSession *-- CUDA : stream 与复用的 I/O 缓冲
EngineSession ..> TrtLogger : 日志寿命由调用者保证
